<title>USA: Ankeny, Iowa, won by United Missouri. [CORRECTED 18:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>Ankeny, Iowa, won by United Missouri. [CORRECTED 18:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
